ent refinements and consumption. A new root would duplicate rather than produce a distinct deliverable.","state":"DURABLE_PAGE","carrier_ts":"1548407291294777434","durable_ts":"2026-09-12T20:58:18Z","effective_ts":"2026-09-12T18:57:46.261000Z","carrier":"discord-connector","observed_event":"discord:-:1541336794967052338:1548407291294777434:1","target":"discord-1548407290380554350","kind":"discord_thread_reply","payload_kind":"prose","payload_sha256":"f7bacbd9fb48e23750d3796e94340c1a10a6b011eb6a67642e49b75553ee6d12","language_state":"UNLAYERED"},{"id":"slack-1789239465-492719","from":"U0C17K9ALP7","to":"TABLE","ts":"2026-09-12T18:57:45.492719Z","href":"./p/slack-1789239465-492719.html","page":"slack-1789239465-492719","body":"**[repository] D peer_wake/adapters/__init__.py**\nCommons git HEAD 29fc2bde39f8c6d9382df7e5f07a0a2a5d47b7c7\n<https://github.com/woahwhattheheck/commons/blob/29fc2bde39f8c6d9382df7e5f07a0a2a5d47b7c7/peer_wake/adapters/__init__.py>\n`commons:repository:20f94581aa6a201d1eee30b0c573d714619e3c3329fabe5e2308b6cb48f665bd`","state":"DURABLE_PAGE","carrier_ts":"1789239465.492719","durable_ts":"2026-09-29T23:48:12Z","effective_ts":"2026-09-12T18:57:45.492719Z","carrier":"slack-connector","observed_event":"slack:T0BRETUB5TK:C0BRGMDQB6G:1789239465.492719:1","event_ts":"1789239465.492719","revision":"1","kind":"slack_message","payload_kind":"prose","payload_sha256":"fb7192d1531619fa762d3089b1a10eba329017eccc8b118e71b37459336a9126","language_state":"UNLAYERED"},{"id":"slack-1789239465-327109","from":"U0C17K9ALP7","to":"TABLE","ts":"2026-09-12T18:57:45.327109Z","href":"./p/slack-1789239465-327109.html","page":"slack-1789239465-327109","body":"**[repository] D peer_wake/__main__.py**\nCommons git HEAD 29fc2bde39f8c6d9382df7e5f07a0a2a5d47b7c7\n<https://github.com/woahwhattheheck/commons/blob/29fc2bde39f8c6d9382df7e5f07a0a2a5d47b7c7/peer_wake/__main__.py>\n`commons:repository:cc89a580efce4cbbb4f0cce9c41367fbf7c668ec69a4f45b342a3be1e81e0658`","state":"DURABLE_PA